      "token": "Task 841 fix — collapsed + zero count (no badge): the exact real production shape (`HeroSearchView`'s filters trigger, `iconOnlyAbove=640 iconOnlyBelow=860`, real `HeroSearch` container's default `activeFiltersCount=0`). Every OTHER collapsed demo above/below always carries a non-zero count, so a badge was always present to balance the icon and give the button a stable content-driven width — this state, with nothing on the right, previously rendered the icon left-of-center AND the button as a non-square rectangle. Fixed by rendering the icon as the Button's own centered label instead of `leftSection`, and pinning the box to a true square at `theme.other.touchTarget` (44px, the same token every square icon-only control in this design system already uses). Force this narrow viewport to see the collapsed state."
